{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">活躍於90年代的兩大男神——林文龍與唐文龍，原來私下交情甚篤，至今更已相識足足30載！日前，林文龍太太郭可盈於社交平台分享了一張好友聚會的大合照，令這對昔日男神驚喜同框，隨即掀起大批劇迷與粉絲的熱烈討論。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，當晚出席聚餐的除了林文龍一家與唐文龍外，還有莫家堯及曹永廉一家等好友。眾人難得聚首一堂，氣氛相當溫馨融洽。郭可盈亦有感而發地在帖文中留言寫道：「Hey，30年的brothers！Friendship forever !」見證著眾人深厚的友誼。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"be80992d-da04-4337-90d6-5f6a65476a24.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026Vga7ptzzFd1787132918.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"be80992d-da04-4337-90d6-5f6a65476a24.jpeg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"a339cfd8-2c5c-4877-84f3-c40782952691.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026kzyd8acBg01787132918.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a339cfd8-2c5c-4877-84f3-c40782952691.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而在這張星光熠熠的合照中，最搶眼及吸引網民目光的，絕對是「雙文龍」同框現身。兩位男神在鏡頭前依然狀態大勇、保養得宜，結實的身材與凍齡的外貌絲毫看不出歲月的痕跡。這班型男的極佳狀態瞬間成為焦點，難怪大批網民看後都紛紛留言驚嘆：「個個後生到」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"cb6b317e-4683-43d5-a0df-1e3ddb4ec03c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026DxVRJASkHh1787132918.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb6b317e-4683-43d5-a0df-1e3ddb4ec03c.jpeg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T05:06:37.130694+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":349,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}